Don Leonardo de la Garza...

587
00:27:37,541 --> 00:27:39,999
Ha confesado ser,
tu verdadero padre.

588
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,666
Y te ha nombrado su
heredera.

589
00:27:42,541 --> 00:27:44,291
<i>Ya no hay nada que nos
separe.</i>

590
00:27:45,875 --> 00:27:47,124
